OL,3,GNEWSACarer at home investigated by BBC
OL,4,Astruck off for threatening elderly man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carer who was secretly filmed mocking
OL,7,Fand threatening an elderly bedbound man
OL,8,Fwith dementia has been struck off.
OL,10,FAmina Sani was found to have threatened
OL,11,Fthe 81-year-old with police and
OL,12,Fthreatened to hit him when he became
OL,13,Fdistressed and lashed out at the
OL,14,Fprospect of being showered against his
OL,15,Fwill.
OL,17,FThe Nigerian worker went on to carry
OL,18,Fout the man's intimate personal care
OL,19,Fwhile a cleaner held his arms down.
