OL,3,GNEWSACarer at home investigated by BBC
OL,4,Astruck off for threatening elderly man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incidents at Castlehill Care Home
OL,7,Fin Inverness on 10 April last year came
OL,8,Fto light after the resident's daughter
OL,9,Finstalled a secret camera in his room
OL,10,Fdue to concerns over his care.
